cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use JIVL in academic or research work, please cite it as below."
title: "JIVL: JVM Intelligence Verification Layer"
abstract: >
  JIVL is an independent open-source verification layer for JVM-focused Agent
  Skills. It produces structural, security, provenance, Java-compilation,
  Maven/Gradle build, JDK-compatibility, and framework-compatibility evidence,
  and defines a reproducible model for agent effectiveness evaluation.
